  "body": "I had a group with 400 members and everything went well but when group members grew, a speed problem occurred on sending a message to the group.\r\n\r\nnow my group have 20,000 members and sending a message in it takes a long time (about 15 sec).\r\n\r\nI tried to fix this problem by using workers and tuning Postgres but no effective changes happened.\r\n\r\nIs there any solution to this problem?\r\n\r\nmy server configuration : \r\n\r\ncpu : 4 core \r\nram : 4 GB\r\nhdd: 25GB ssd\r\n \r\n",
